{"asset_key":"mn3/env_story_10351450","episode":"mn3","category":"env_story","story_id":"10351450","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1035145001:1":{"text":"근처? 음... 유적에 대해 묻는 건가요?","source_cn":"附近？唔……你是指遗迹还是什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1C6B1D6236CE5A43","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1035145002:0":{"text":"아, 참, 이 근처에는 상회의 사람들이 많다고 들었어요.","source_cn":"噢对了，说起来附近有很多商会的人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x70CF7ECBD3AF4743","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1035145003:1":{"text":"하지만 이 근처에는 유적뿐인데... 설마 그들이 유적에서 긁어모은 진귀한 고물들을 팔고 있는 건 아니겠죠?! 그러면 안 되는데! 고고학 현장을 망가뜨리게 될 거예요!","source_cn":"但这附近只有遗迹……难道他们在贩卖遗迹里搜刮出来的珍贵...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB816B20C48AA5068","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:冬青学者维娜":{"text":"학자 베르나","source":"冬青学者维娜","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":1}}